<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia rises to 1.8550 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia rises to 1.8550 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia rose to 1.8550 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange on Thursday from 1.8580 to the dollar at the previous session.</p>
<p>					  June 12	    June 11</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8550	     1.8580</p>
<p> Volume traded			$24.14 million	 $35.14 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380-44-244-9150</p>
</text>
